{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>And you shall keep My charge, so as not to do the statutes of the abominations.</b> Keep also the commandments that I commanded as safeguards and fences, so that you do not stumble in any of these — such as the prohibitions of forbidden foods and the impurity of a menstruant, a zavah, a woman who gave birth, and the like — and in this manner you shall not become defiled through them."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:36:48.320599341Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}